  # create - Create a new ticket workspace under the docs root                
                                                                              
  Creates a new ticket workspace directory with the standard structure.       
                                                                              
  Examples:                                                                   
                                                                              
  # Create a ticket (default root + default date-based path template)         
                                                                              
  docmgr ticket create --ticket MEN-3475 --title "Chat API cleanup" --topics  
  chat,llm-                                                                   
  workflow                                                                    
                                                                              
  # Create with multiple topics                                               
                                                                              
  docmgr ticket create --ticket MEN-8888 --title "WebSocket reconnection plan" --
  topics chat,backend,websocket                                               
                                                                              
  # Create under a custom path template (relative to --root)                  
                                                                              
  docmgr ticket create --ticket MEN-9999 --title "Scratch ticket for          
  experiments"  --                                                            
  root ttmp --path-template "examples/{{TICKET}}--{{SLUG}}"                   
                                                                              
  For more help, run: docmgr help create                                      
                                                                              
  Run docmgr help --ui to open the interactive help TUI.                      
                                                                              
  ## Usage:                                                                   
                                                                              
  docmgr ticket create [flags]                                                
                                                                              
  ## Aliases:                                                                 
                                                                              
  create, create-ticket                                                       
                                                                              
  ## Flags:                                                                   
                                                                              
                   --force    Force overwrite of existing files - <bool>      
                -h, --help    help for create                                 
